                                                "example_id": "5c34e1ed-0086-4b6e-b09b-a62b77dbca50",
                                                "sense_id": "409460d3-48dc-3f23-8c32-400bdc2d3854",
                                                "text": "“Besides,” Linda piped in, “your little pokies will be fine in a halter.” They all laughed and Terri relaxed a little."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "57bcc1f8-1f08-4978-a3d9-0dff2bcea762",
                                                "sense_id": "409460d3-48dc-3f23-8c32-400bdc2d3854",
                                                "text": "His eyes flick up and down, then it's like he notices my pokies and makes a point not to stare."
